'''Deontez Alexander''' (born July 25, 1996) is an American former professional [[gridiron football|football]] [[wide receiver]]. He played [[college football]] at [[Franklin Grizzlies|Franklin]]. He has been a member of the [[Detroit Lions]] and [[Seattle Seahawks]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL), the [[Houston Roughnecks (2020)|Houston Roughnecks]] of the [[XFL (2020)|XFL]], the [[Houston Gamblers (2022)|Houston Gamblers]] of the [[United States Football League (2022)|United States Football League]] (USFL), and the [[Winnipeg Blue Bombers]] and [[Edmonton Elks]] of the [[Canadian Football League]] (CFL).
